{"id":315,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"三段階の学びで探究と進路を育てる","feature_description":"明星Institution中等教育部は、中高6年間をA（1・2年）・B（3・4年）・C（5・6年）の三つのブロックに分け、MIシラバスに沿った独自のカリキュラムを実施する。Aでは基礎学力を築き、Bでは知識を応用して論理的思考力や創造性を育み、Cでは多様な選択科目を通じて進路目標の達成と実社会の課題解決を目指す。成長段階に合わせて学びを深める構成である。","clubs":[{"id":13485,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13486,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13487,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13488,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13489,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13490,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13491,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13492,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13493,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13494,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13495,"name":"バトミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://institution.meisei.ac.jp/school-life/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13496,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部